# Stilwell Farms - renovation-style variants of the farm extras (coop, greenhouse, silo, shed) so every
# building matches the chosen style. Textures are sampled from that style's house + barn:
#   MODERN  white board + charcoal cladding, black standing-seam metal, black-framed glass, cedar, concrete.
#   CABIN   round logs with cut ends, green standing-seam metal (GRASS pal, follows seasons), stonework, lit windows.
#   COTTAGE thatch, whitewash / fieldstone, arched f/K plank doors under a thatch hood, roses.
# Coops: door bottom-left cell. Greenhouses: door bottom-middle. Sheds: door at the bottom. Grass = exact GRASS.

